    <guid isPermaLink="false">69cf9fccb977fb2c47085511</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 03 Apr 2026 11:20:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>赶在节前献上一期八卦内容，所以，Hello！内娱的这些“祸害”有人来管管吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎加入粉丝群，想听什么直接点！（wx🛰️搜"louyuan10"添加即可哟）</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播-无心：微博@</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1747334895" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1747334895"><span>云会</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>主播-木木：微博@</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1584488640" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1584488640"><span>Mumublank</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="20">00:20</a> 踩坑AI生成工具，150元充值未产出一条可用视频</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 拆解AI短剧创作痛点，人物场景服装一致性难把控</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="160">02:40</a> 吐槽AI短剧行业乱象，本该解放人力却陷抽卡式内卷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> 锐评郭敬明新作，审美固化套路化难有创作新意</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">05:30</a> 拆解郭敬明与鞠婧祎共性，困在大众审美里难破局</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="455">07:35</a> 吐槽《月鳞绮纪》画面，固化审美拍出聊斋鬼片既视感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">09:30</a> 淡颜系女星对比，陈都灵与章泽天的上镜颜值差异</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 锐评陈飞宇颜值硬伤，骨性下颌问题仅俯拍能修饰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="850">14:10</a> 热巴与鞠婧祎演技PK，一人灵动一人可被AI完全替代</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 拆解AI捏脸底层逻辑，标准模板捏不出有辨识度的脸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a> 锐评古偶妆造乱象，“粉底液将军”泛滥失真无质感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 从AI人设跑偏，聊内娱艺人的人设割裂与一致性难题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> AI行业前瞻，未来人人可做AI管理者实现效率翻倍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a> 《浪姐 6》嘉宾前瞻，盘点潜力艺人与舞台逆袭机会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1960">32:40</a> 单依纯版权争议，无授权演唱甩锅团队巡演翻唱占比过高</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> 吐槽乐坛审丑乱象，者来女舞台疯癫难有内核支撑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2770">46:10</a> 锐评内娱95后小生，颜值普遍拉胯丑男横行无记忆点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2950">49:10</a> 痛批丝芭传媒吃相难看，终评内娱乱象比AI剧本更离谱</span></p>]]></description>
